  "contracts": [
    "feed/snapshot/query/SGR do not seal; first scalar owns cluster style; current prefix cursor is immediately observable",
    "mutating terminal events seal; Unicode 17 extended grapheme segmentation and unicode-width 0.2.2 non-CJK string width",
    "1-to-2 right-margin growth wraps whole cluster; 2-to-1 retains already committed wrap/scroll; INSERT uses bounded local width-delta changes",
    "one-column/no-autowrap footprints explicitly clip while preserving full scalars",
    "64 scalars/256 UTF-8 bytes per lossless fragment, saturating overflow counter; overflow layout is not claimed as one complete EGC",
    "leading wrap padding is explicitly distinguished from real written spaces; wide pairs are cleared atomically before INSERT shift; zero-width Prepend retains forward context"
  ],
